---
title: "Time machine"
note: "One place, nine eras, one locked camera: the reel stays on the same spot while a time-lapse rushes it from 1850 to the year 3000, and every clip is a new era with its own people, vehicles and sound (time/eras, one per chunk by its era property). Dial $place for a harbour, a village square or your own street. Nine clips on Motion Context."
tags: [loops, h3, reel, motion_context]
---
@h3 t2va 16:9
context: 22
style: live-action, cinematic, photorealistic, a camera locked on a tripod at head height
$place = {a street corner by an old railway bridge|a small harbour front with a stone quay|a village square around a fountain|a crossroads in a river town}
MUSIC: N/A

CHUNK 1850
$era = __time/eras#era:1850__
SHOT 10s | static
$place in 1850: $era. People go about the day in front of the fixed camera. In the last seconds a time-lapse begins: days and nights flicker past faster and faster.
SFX: $era.sfx
HANDOFF: days and nights flicker past faster and faster over $place

CHUNK 1920
$era = __time/eras#era:1920__
SHOT 10s | static
The flickering slows and settles on $place in the 1920s: $era. People pass close to the camera, going about their day. In the last seconds the time-lapse starts again.
SFX: $era.sfx
HANDOFF: days and nights flicker past faster and faster over $place

CHUNK 1955
$era = __time/eras#era:1955__
SHOT 10s | static
The flickering slows and settles on $place in the 1950s: $era. People pass close to the camera, going about their day. In the last seconds the time-lapse starts again.
SFX: $era.sfx
HANDOFF: days and nights flicker past faster and faster over $place

