CHUNK 2200
$era = __time/eras#era:2200__
SHOT 10s | static
The flickering slows and settles on $place in 2200: $era. A few people pass close to the camera. In the last seconds the time-lapse starts again, faster than ever.
SFX: $era.sfx
HANDOFF: days and nights flicker past faster and faster over $place

CHUNK 3000
$era = __time/eras#era:3000__
SHOT 10s | static
The flickering slows for the last time and settles on where $place used to be, in the year 3000: $era. Nothing moves but the leaves and the grazing deer. The shot holds in the quiet.
SFX: $era.sfx
